d to work in the United States&nbsp;from consideration for purposes of Social Security eligibility and benefits.</p><p>This exclusion applies with respect to all such wages and self-employment income earned both before and after the bill’s enactment. However, any change to the amount of an individual’s Social Security benefits as a result of these provisions may only apply to benefits for months after the bill’s enactment. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-29T20:01:15Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"No Social Security for Illegal Aliens Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-11-20T09:06:35Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-11-20T09:06:35Z"}
